docs {
  # Get ASH Exit Detail
  
  Retrieves the full detail of a single ASH exit record by its unique identifier.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                |
  |-----------|--------|----------|----------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the exit record    |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete ASH exit record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": {
      "firstName": "string",
      "surname": "string",
      "id": "uuid",
      "studentId": "uuid",
      "ageAtExit": 14,
      "schoolName": "string",
      "classAtExit": "string",
      "durationInProgram": "string",
      "exitReason": "string",
      "academicImpactRating": 7,
      "areasOfImprovement": ["string"] | null,
      "mentorshipReceived": "string",
      "mentorshipImpactRating": 8 | null,
      "postAshStatus": "string",
      "institutionName": "string" | null,
      "courseOfStudy": "string" | null,
      "vocationalSkill": "string" | null,
      "enjoyedMost": "string" | null,
      "programImpact": "string" | null,
      "improvementSuggestions": "string" | null,
      "facilitatorName": "string",
      "exitDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
      "updatedAt": "ISO 8601" | null,
      "createdAt": "ISO 8601",
      "deletedAt": "ISO 8601" | null
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                    | Type     | Description                                                      |
  |--------------------------|----------|------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | firstName                | string   | Student's first name (joined from ASH student record).           |
  | surname                  | string   | Student's surname (joined from ASH student record).              |
  | id                       | string   | UUID primary key.                                                |
  | studentId                | string   | UUID reference to the ASH student record.                        |
  | ageAtExit                | number   | Student's age at the time of exit (6–18).                        |
  | schoolName               | string   | Name of the school at exit.                                      |
  | classAtExit              | string   | Class/grade at the time of exit.                                 |
  | durationInProgram        | string   | How long the student was in the programme.                       |
  | exitReason               | string   | Reason for leaving the programme.                                |
  | academicImpactRating     | number   | Rating of academic impact (1–10).                                |
  | areasOfImprovement       | string[] | Areas where the student improved (nullable).                     |
  | mentorshipReceived       | string   | Description of mentorship received.                              |
  | mentorshipImpactRating   | number   | Rating of mentorship impact (1–10, nullable).                    |
  | postAshStatus            | string   | Student's status after leaving ASH.                              |
  | institutionName          | string   | Name of institution if continuing education (nullable).          |
  | courseOfStudy             | string   | Course of study if applicable (nullable).                        |
  | vocationalSkill          | string   | Vocational skill pursued if applicable (nullable).               |
  | enjoyedMost              | string   | What the student enjoyed most about the programme (nullable).    |
  | programImpact            | string   | Description of programme impact (nullable).                      |
  | improvementSuggestions   | string   | Suggestions for programme improvement (nullable).                |
  | facilitatorName          | string   | Name of the facilitator completing the form.                     |
  | exitDate                 | string   | Date of exit (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                                     |
  | updatedAt                | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                    |
  | createdAt                | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                           |
  | deletedAt                | string   | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                       |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                 |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                    |
}
